# Dragon Ball - Final Bout (Europe). No patch yet: what other releases' patches do, and
# why they were not ported, so that nobody looks again for nothing.
; Serials: SLES-03735
;
; Skipped: "Widescreen 16:9" (Spain, SLES-03685, by PeterDelta, in DuckStation's
; database). It sets two halfwords of 0x1000 (1.0) to 0x1555 (4/3) and 0x0C00 (3/4), at
; 8002F988 and 8003BD80 in the Spanish build. They are data, or code loaded from the disc
; while the game runs (the boot executable holds a table there); the European build has
; 0x1000 at both addresses too, but setting them changes nothing on screen (checked in a
; fight), and the lines alone do not tell which values they are elsewhere.
